concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-96b-ss-6 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-powers-and-offences-act-2012-sch-4-sec-96b-ss-6-logic-deontic-1 .
